  "passive": {
    "id": "YuumiP",
    "path": "Characters/Yuumi/Spells/YuumiPAbility/YuumiP",
    "locKeys": {
      "keyName": "Spell_YuumiPassive_Name",
      "keySummary": "Spell_YuumiPassive_Summary",
      "keyTooltip": "Spell_YuumiPassive_Tooltip"
    },
    "localized": {
      "ko_KR": {
        "name": "야옹이 친구",
        "summary": "기본 공격이나 스킬로 챔피언을 맞히면 주기적으로 유미가 체력을 회복하고 다음으로 밀착하는 아군의 체력을 회복시킵니다.<br><br>유미는 밀착한 아군과 특별한 유대를 형성합니다. 가장 유대가 긴밀한 아군에게 밀착한 동안 유미의 스킬이 강화됩니다.",
        "tooltip": "유미의 기본 공격 및 스킬이 챔피언을 공격하면 <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\"><span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\">체력을 (30% 주문력)</span></span> 회복합니다. 유미가 4초 안에 아군에게 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">밀착</span>하면 아군도 체력을 <span>회복</span>합니다. 이 효과의 재사용 대기시간은 20초입니다.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">밀착</span> 상태에서 아군이 챔피언 또는 미니언을 처치하면 유미가 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">우정</span>을 쌓습니다. 가장 많은 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">우정</span>을 쌓은 아군이 유미의 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">단짝</span>이 되고 유미가 단짝에게 <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">밀착</span>하면 추가 스킬 효과를 얻습니다. <br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">유미가 이미 아군에게 밀착된 상태라면 자동으로 체력을 회복합니다.</span>"
      },
      "en_US": {
        "name": "Feline Friendship",
        "summary": "Periodically, when Yuumi strikes a champion with an attack or ability, she restores health to herself and the next ally she Attaches to.<br><br>While Attached, Yuumi generates a special bond with her allies. The ally with the strongest bond enhances Yuumi's abilities while she is Attached to them.",
        "tooltip": "When Yuumi's Attacks and Abilities strike champions, she heals herself for <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\"><span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\">(30% Ability Power) health</span></span>. If Yuumi <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Attaches</span> to an ally within 4 seconds, they are <span>healed</span> as well. This effect has a 20 second Cooldown.<br /><br />While <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Attached</span>, Yuumi gains <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Friendship</span> with her ally whenever they kill a champion or minion. The ally with the most <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Friendship</span> becomes her <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Best Friend</span> and grants Yuumi bonus effects to her Abilities while she is <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Attached</span> to them. <br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The heal will automatically trigger if Yuumi is already Attached to an ally.</span>"
      },
      "zh_CN": {
        "name": "猫的博爱",
        "summary": "周期性地，当悠米用一个攻击或技能击中一个英雄时，她会为自身和她要附身的下一个友方英雄回复生命值。<br><br>在附身于友方英雄时，悠米会与她的友方英雄们生成一个特殊羁绊。在附身于拥有最强羁绊的那名友方英雄时，悠米的各个技能会获得强化。",
        "tooltip": "当悠米的攻击和技能击中英雄时，她会治疗自身<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\"><span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\">(30% 法术强度)生命值</span></span>。如果悠米在4秒里<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">附身</span>至一名友方英雄，那么这个英雄也会获得<span>治疗</span>。这个效果有20秒冷却时间。<br /><br />在<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">附身</span>状态时，悠米和她附身的英雄每击杀一个英雄或小兵都会使悠米获得与该英雄的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">友谊值</span>。拥有最多<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">友谊值</span>的友军会成为她的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">挚友</span>，并会在被悠米<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">附身</span>时为她的各个技能提供额外效果。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">如果悠米已附身于一个友方英雄，那么这个治疗会自动触发。</span>"
      }
    }
  }
